              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Caren"
            },
            "reviewBody": "They are easy and do look impressive and are very tasty. The dough is super sticky. I sprayed my hands with oil before rolling it into walnut sized balls. I came out with 4 dozen cookies. Thanks Connie!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
