            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "thedailygourmet"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good for a quick cookie, but the cool whip creates a more cake like texture, and not a chewy cookie. I read others had issues with the dough being sticky so I used a spring hinged cookie scoop and sprinkled the cinnamon sugar mixture over the top.",
            "datePublished": "2017-09-10T23:10:51.277Z"
          },
          {
