              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "monymony71"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The dough is so sticky after making I have found that freezing it for a bit before rolling into balls and baking makes it easier to work with",
            "datePublished": "2019-11-14T12:39:49.450Z"
          },
          {
