              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Wendy Schwab"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These cookies sounded good, but didn't turn out that way! First of all they are so sticky that you can't roll them into balls; they wouldn't bake (after 18 minutes the middles were still doughy) and they stuck to the pan. I threw all of them away... what a waste!",
