              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was looking for something easy to do on a lazy Sunday afternoon, and this recipe was exactly what I was looking for. It tastes just like a snickerdoodle and is so easy to make.",
